 top or bottom part of the current system, respectively. A value of also-top or also-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bottom indicates that the number should appear on both the current part and the top or bottom part of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current system, respectively. If these values appear in a score, when parts are created the number should only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appear once in this part, not twice. A value of none indicates that the number is associated only with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current part, not with the system.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber/onlyBottom":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlybottom","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number appears only on the bottom part of the current system."}],"title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyBottom","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyBottom","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyBottom"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}